    <string name="sh_fix_version">Use a compatible server release and let its installer finish the upgrade.</string>
    <string name="sh_guide">1. Install Docker and the UNYRI server on a PC that stays on. 2. Choose a domain or DDNS name. 3. Reserve the PC address in the router and forward HTTPS and call ports. With CGNAT, use a VPS or tunnel. 4. Confirm the HTTPS server address or scan an invitation QR. 5. Sign in, open Profile and claim ownership with the installer code, then protect administrator access. 6. Open Administration → Own server → Check server. Configuration checks do not prove external ports work; test from mobile data. Back up before updates. Push notifications need a configured provider.</string>
